      {
       "text": "latest Fedora 6.5.1 release is still using jquery version 1.12.4 which is out of date and is vulnerable CVE-2019-11358 affecting jquery version 1.8.0 to 3.3.1  upgrading jquery to version above 3.3.1 should resolve this issue",
