     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A2e87e1c9-44d7-4a83-ae7b-b16b225ed7a4\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:2e87e1c9-44d7-4a83-ae7b-b16b225ed7a4\" data-account-id=\"557058:2e87e1c9-44d7-4a83-ae7b-b16b225ed7a4\" accountid=\"557058:2e87e1c9-44d7-4a83-ae7b-b16b225ed7a4\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Calvin Xu</a> I’m afraid the recent dependency upgrade developments have pushed the requirements to Java 21. I hadn’t intended to back port the fix to 6.x but it is possibly something we can explore at the Tech meeting today. </p>",
